<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Drypers upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Drypers upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Boston analyst Lynn Hyman said she upgraded Drypers Corp to a buy from a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- said company is turning around, gaining market share and expanding into rapidly growing emerging markets.</p>
<p>-- 12-month price target is $7.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 earnings $0.50 a share, compared with $0.09 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1998 earnings $0.70 a share.</p>
</text>
